      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.97300000000007,
        "t": 95.46001953125005,
        "r": 407.31300000000005,
        "b": 87.01233441674617
      },
      "content": " Adjust the microswitches after refitting or replacing old with new door switches."
    },
    {
